        "original_id": "5ed3743d-9e04-5293-b364-5c925ef66091",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Golden Egg, The Vanishing (1988 film)\n- People: Tim Krabbé, Gene Bervoets\n- Topics: psychological thriller, disappearance, obsession\n\nFacts:\n- Tim Krabbé wrote The Golden Egg, a Dutch psychological thriller novella first published in 1984.\n- The Golden Egg is titled Het Gouden Ei in Dutch and was published as The Vanishing in English-speaking countries.\n- The Golden Egg centers on a man obsessed with discovering the fate of his lover, who vanished years earlier.\n- In The Golden Egg, the man confronts his lover’s abductor and sacrifices his own life to learn the truth.\n- Gene Bervoets stars in the 1988 film The Vanishing as a man who obsessively searches for his girlfriend after she disappears at a rest area.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
